    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得400绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷5</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n      愿您的非凡之路平稳顺利。\n      在这个世界的旅途中，您是否曾踏入那座笼罩在迷雾中的古老庄园？您是否战胜了那忠诚的看门猎犬，击败了身披铠甲的守卫，又与那位管家展开了一场激烈的交锋？ \n      然而，五月庄园的秘密远不止于此。在更深的幽暗之中，仍有未曾揭开的谜团在等待着勇敢的探索者。诚邀您通过信件中的隐秘通道，将您的经历、感受与建议分享给我们——无论是已经历的挑战，还是对未来探索的期待。您的每一份建议，都将助我们雕琢出更真实的世界。\n      感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red> \"Complete the questionnaire to receive 400 bound pounds!\" </>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\"> Open Beta Survey 5 </>\n Dear Beyonder: \n May your path as a Beyonder be smooth and steady. \n In your journey through this world, have you ever stepped into that ancient manor shrouded in mist? Have you overcome the loyal guard hound, defeated the armored guards, and engaged in a fierce confrontation with the butler? \n However, the secrets of May Manor go far beyond this. In the deeper darkness, there are still unsolved mysteries waiting for brave explorers. We cordially invite you to share your experiences, feelings, and suggestions with us through the secret channel in your letter—whether it be the challenges you have already faced or your expectations for future exploration. Every suggestion you provide will help us sculpt a more authentic world. \n Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion soon and master the extraordinary.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得400绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷3</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n    我们的测试旅程已进行到第三天。这短短旅途中您的每一次战斗、每一次选择、每一次对这个世界产生的好奇心，都为我们照亮了前路。此时此刻，我们希望能再次聆听您的声音。这不仅仅是一次问卷，更是您为《诡秘之主》未来正式降临，所投下的重要一票。您所传递的一切声音，都将成为我们前行的锚点。\n    感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire to receive 400 Bound Gold Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 3</>\nDear Beyonder: \n    Our test journey has reached its third day. Every battle, every choice, and every curiosity you have had about this world during this short journey has illuminated our path forward. At this moment, we hope to hear your voice again. This is not just a questionnaire, but an important vote you have cast for the future official descent of Lord of Mysteries. Every voice you convey will become an anchor for us to move forward. \n    Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Beyonder powers soon.",
